  "body": "HTML Standard-size changes for https://github.com/w3c/preload/issues/120\n\nTODO:\n\n - [x] Consider an _obtain the preload resource_ override for _obtain the resource_ under the Link type \"preload\" section, that:\n    - Checks to see if `as` == `image`, and if so\n    - Do some stuff similar to step 9 and below in [update the image data](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/images.html#updating-the-image-data:the-img-element-5) (like calling the image selection algorithm etc)\n    - Otherwise defer to general [obtain the resource](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/semantics.html#concept-link-obtain) algorithm\n - [x] List `imagesrcset` and `imagesizes` mutations under [appropriate times](https://w3c.github.io/preload/#processing) (PR is up)\n\nWould appreciate some thoughts thus far; is this even the direction we want to go, i.e., making some of the algorithms in the images section fit the `link` element? /cc @zcorpan\n\n\n<!--\n    This comment and the below content is programatically generated.\n    You may add a comma-separated list of anchors you'd like a\n    direct link to below (e.g. #idl-serializers, #idl-sequence):\n\n    Don't remove this comment or modify anything below this line.\n    If you don't want a preview generated for this pull request,\n    just replace the whole of this comment's content by \"no preview\"\n    and remove what's below.\n-->\n***\n<a href=\"https://whatpr.org/html/4048/images.html\" title=\"Last updated on Feb 23, 2019, 3:21 AM UTC (f0e7cd7)\">/images.html</a>  ( <a href=\"https://whatpr.org/html/4048/9ebceb0...f0e7cd7/images.html\" title=\"Last updated on Feb 23, 2019, 3:21 AM UTC (f0e7cd7)\">diff</a> )\n<a href=\"https://whatpr.org/html/4048/index.html\" title=\"Last updated on Feb 23, 2019, 3:21 AM UTC (f0e7cd7)\">/index.html</a>  ( <a href=\"https://whatpr.org/html/4048/9ebceb0...f0e7cd7/index.html\" title=\"Last updated on Feb 23, 2019, 3:21 AM UTC (f0e7cd7)\">diff</a> )\n<a href=\"https://whatpr.org/html/4048/indices.html\" title=\"Last updated on Feb 23, 2019, 3:21 AM UTC (f0e7cd7)\">/indices.html</a>  ( <a href=\"https://whatpr.org/html/4048/9ebceb0...f0e7cd7/indices.html\" title=\"Last updated on Feb 23, 2019, 3:21 AM UTC (f0e7cd7)\">diff</a> )\n<a href=\"https://whatpr.org/html/4048/links.html\" title=\"Last updated on Feb 23, 2019, 3:21 AM UTC (f0e7cd7)\">/links.html</a>  ( <a href=\"https://whatpr.org/html/4048/9ebceb0...f0e7cd7/links.html\" title=\"Last updated on Feb 23, 2019, 3:21 AM UTC (f0e7cd7)\">diff</a> )\n<a href=\"https://whatpr.org/html/4048/semantics.html\" title=\"Last updated on Feb 23, 2019, 3:21 AM UTC (f0e7cd7)\">/semantics.html</a>  ( <a href=\"https://whatpr.org/html/4048/9ebceb0...f0e7cd7/semantics.html\" title=\"Last updated on Feb 23, 2019, 3:21 AM UTC (f0e7cd7)\">diff</a> )",
